recommend keep-going The queue's lead is ungated and unchanged: provision_notes at 2,093 across 24 rungs, weigh_the_term at 2,001 across 30, record_the_dispute at 1,891 across 32. weigh_the_term is the better crux -- thirty rungs against twenty-four, and provision_notes at ninety-one lines is the kind of body most likely to reach a rung's own wire, which is what keeps a body home. Hash the family before folding it either way. The one gate worth Keaton's eye stays small and unchanged: jinja2 and ply on the pier's Python environment open types.h, syscalls.h, bootinfo.h, faults.h, and the sel4.h umbrella in a single step, which is an environment change and so his word.
